":62,"end":64,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m071-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"楚成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m071-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m071-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m071-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p095","text":"三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭告急晉。晉使荀林父將中軍，隨會將上軍，趙朔將下軍，郤克、欒書、先縠、韓厥、鞏朔佐之。六月，至河。聞楚已服鄭，鄭伯肉袒與盟而去，荀林父欲還。先縠曰：「凡來救鄭，不至不可，將率離心。」卒度河。楚已服鄭，欲飲馬于河爲名而去。楚與晉軍大戰。鄭新附楚，畏之，反助楚攻晉。晉軍敗，走河，爭度，船中人指甚衆。楚虜我將智罃。歸而林父曰：「臣爲督將，軍敗當誅，請死。」景公欲許之。隨會曰：「昔文公之與楚戰城濮，成王歸殺子玉，而文公乃喜。今楚已敗我師，又誅其將，是助楚殺仇也。」乃止。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"覆核更正：原連cbr-p000398楚成王；本提及是同句楚莊王的王，改連cbr-p000257。提及ID、字位及原文不變。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"荀林父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000408","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001783","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"郤克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001149","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0