"person_id":"cbr-p000398","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001751","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m095-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p017","text":"夏，伐宋，宋告急於晉，晉救宋，成王罷歸。將軍子玉請戰，成王曰：「重耳亡居外久，卒得反國，天之所開，不可當。」子玉固請，乃與之少師而去。晉果敗子玉於城濮。成王怒，誅子玉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001882","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001977","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001882","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001977","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001977","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001882","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"子玉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001977","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","w